        "SecutgInviteAccept": ["en": "Import and join", "zh-Hans": "导入并加入", "zh-Hant": "匯入並加入"],
        "SecutgInviteAccepted": ["en": "Joined the encrypted group “{title}”, public key registered", "zh-Hans": "已加入加密群「{title}」，公钥已登记", "zh-Hant": "已加入加密群組「{title}」，公鑰已登記"],
        "SecutgInviteCardBody": ["en": "Tap the button: ① the group key is imported on this device ② your public key is registered in the group automatically ③ from then on group messages are encrypted and decrypted for you.", "zh-Hans": "点下面的按钮：① 群密钥导入本机 ② 自动在群里登记你的公钥 ③ 之后群消息自动加密解密，不用再操作。", "zh-Hant": "點下面的按鈕：① 群組金鑰匯入本機 ② 自動在群組裡登記你的公鑰 ③ 之後群組訊息自動加密解密，不用再操作。"],
