        "SecutgLostDeviceTooFresh": ["en": "This device signed in less than 24 hours ago, and Telegram does not let it end other devices yet. Do this on a device that has been signed in longer.", "zh-Hans": "本机登录不到 24 小时，Telegram 暂不允许从这里结束其它设备。请到一台登录较久的设备上操作。", "zh-Hant": "本機登入不到 24 小時，Telegram 暫不允許從這裡結束其他裝置。請到一台登入較久的裝置上操作。"],
