        "SecutgOnboardAuto": ["en": "Automatic pairing", "zh-Hans": "自动配对", "zh-Hant": "自動配對"],
        "SecutgOnboardAutoConfirm": ["en": "This sends a public-key registration message into this chat. If they don't have Si4Gram installed, they will see a line of text they can't read — which also tells them you are using an encryption tool. After pairing you must compare the 12-digit safety code through a channel outside this app. Until you do, it counts only as standard and unverified.", "zh-Hans": "这会在本对话里发出一条公钥登记消息。如果对方没有安装 Si4Gram，他会看到一串看不懂的文本——这也等于告诉他你在用一个加密工具。配对完成后，你需要通过本软件之外的渠道核对 12 位安全码；核对之前只算「标准 · 未验证」。", "zh-Hant": "這會在本對話裡發出一條公鑰登記訊息。如果對方沒有安裝 Si4Gram，他會看到一串看不懂的文字——這也等於告訴他你在用一個加密工具。配對完成後，你需要透過本軟體之外的渠道核對 12 位安全碼；核對之前只算「標準 · 未驗證」。"],
        "SecutgOnboardAutoHint": ["en": "Exchanges public keys inside this chat, done in seconds. The keys pass through Telegram's servers, so you must compare the safety code afterwards.", "zh-Hans": "在这个对话里交换公钥，几秒完成。公钥经过 Telegram 服务器，配对后必须核对安全码。", "zh-Hant": "在這個對話裡交換公鑰，幾秒完成。公鑰經過 Telegram 伺服器，配對後必須核對安全碼。"],
        "SecutgOnboardAutoSend": ["en": "Send invitation", "zh-Hans": "发送邀请", "zh-Hant": "發送邀請"],
        "SecutgOnboardBody": ["en": "Once on, messages are encrypted on your device and the Telegram server only ever sees ciphertext.", "zh-Hans": "开启后，消息在设备上加密，Telegram 服务器只能看到密文。", "zh-Hant": "開啟後，訊息在裝置上加密，Telegram 伺服器只能看到密文。"],
        "SecutgOnboardIncoming": ["en": "{name} invites you to start an encrypted chat", "zh-Hans": "{name} 邀请你开始加密对话", "zh-Hant": "{name} 邀請你開始加密對話"],
