        "SecutgPairDialogBody": ["en": "After you accept, messages between you are encrypted on your devices. the Telegram server only sees ciphertext.\n\nIf your account is signed in on several devices, only the first device that taps “Accept” completes the pairing. Your other devices will need to import the key from that device later.", "zh-Hans": "接受后，双方消息将在设备上加密，Telegram 服务器只能看到密文。\n\n如果你的账号登录在多台设备上，只有第一台点「接受」的设备会完成配对，其它设备之后需要从这台设备导入密钥。", "zh-Hant": "接受後，雙方訊息將在裝置上加密，Telegram 伺服器只能看到密文。\n\n如果你的帳號登入在多台裝置上，只有第一台點「接受」的裝置會完成配對，其它裝置之後需要從這台裝置匯入金鑰。"],
        "SecutgPairDialogTitle": ["en": "{name} invites you to start an encrypted chat", "zh-Hans": "{name} 邀请你开始加密对话", "zh-Hant": "{name} 邀請你開始加密對話"],
        "SecutgPairDoneBody": ["en": "Safety code: {code}\n\nTo make sure nobody in between swapped the keys, compare these 12 digits with the other person outside this app (phone call, in person, or another trusted app). Only a match means the chat is safe.", "zh-Hans": "安全码：{code}\n\n为了防止中间渠道替换密钥，请通过此软件之外的渠道（电话、当面或其它可信应用）与对方核对这 12 位数字，两边一致才安全。", "zh-Hant": "安全碼：{code}\n\n為了防止中間渠道替換金鑰，請透過此軟體之外的渠道（電話、當面或其它可信應用）與對方核對這 12 位數字，兩邊一致才安全。"],
        "SecutgPairDoneLine": ["en": "🔐 Encryption is on for this chat. Safety code: {code}. To make sure nobody in between swapped the keys, compare the code outside this app. once it matches you can chat securely here.", "zh-Hans": "🔐 本对话已启用加密。安全码：{code}。为了防止中间渠道替换密钥，请通过此软件之外的渠道核对安全码；核对一致后即可在此加密聊天。", "zh-Hant": "🔐 本對話已啟用加密。安全碼：{code}。為了防止中間渠道替換金鑰，請透過此軟體之外的渠道核對安全碼；核對一致後即可在此加密聊天。"],
        "SecutgPairDoneTitle": ["en": "Paired. This chat is now encrypted", "zh-Hans": "配对完成，本对话已加密", "zh-Hant": "配對完成，本對話已加密"],
        "SecutgPairDuplicate": ["en": "🔐 Duplicate pairing message ignored", "zh-Hans": "🔐 已忽略重复的配对消息", "zh-Hant": "🔐 已忽略重複的配對訊息"],
        "SecutgPairFailed": ["en": "Pairing failed: {error}", "zh-Hans": "配对失败：{error}", "zh-Hant": "配對失敗：{error}"],
        "SecutgPairInvite": ["en": "🔐 They invited you to start encrypted messaging", "zh-Hans": "🔐 对方邀请开启加密通讯", "zh-Hant": "🔐 對方邀請開啟加密通訊"],
        "SecutgPairInviteHint": ["en": "🔐 They invited you to start encrypted messaging — tap the lock button and choose “Accept pairing”", "zh-Hans": "🔐 对方邀请开启加密通讯 — 点锁钮选择「同意配对」", "zh-Hant": "🔐 對方邀請開啟加密通訊 — 點鎖鈕選擇「同意配對」"],
        "SecutgPairInviteSent": ["en": "Encrypted-chat invitation sent. Waiting for them to accept.", "zh-Hans": "已向对方发出加密对话邀请，等待对方接受", "zh-Hant": "已向對方發出加密對話邀請，等待對方接受"],
