        "SecutgRelayChatRelay": ["en": "Relay for this chat", "zh-Hans": "本聊天使用的中转", "zh-Hant": "本聊天使用的中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayChatTitle": ["en": "Message relay for this chat", "zh-Hans": "本聊天的信息中转", "zh-Hant": "本聊天的訊息中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayComposeTag": ["en": "⇄ Sending through the message relay · {policy}", "zh-Hans": "⇄ 通过信息中转发送 · {policy}", "zh-Hant": "⇄ 透過訊息中轉傳送 · {policy}"],
        "SecutgRelayCopy": ["en": "Copy", "zh-Hans": "复制", "zh-Hant": "複製"],
        "SecutgRelayCustomPrivacyNote": ["en": "A custom relay is one you deploy and manage yourself. Content sent through it is stored only on your own server, and Si4Gram never handles or sees it. Keeping that data private, and deciding how long it is kept, is up to the server you deploy.", "zh-Hans": "自定义信息中转站由你自己部署、自己管理：经它发送的内容只存在你自己的服务器上，Si4Gram 既不经手也看不到。这些数据的隐私与保存期限，由你部署的服务器来保证。", "zh-Hant": "自訂資訊中轉站由你自己部署、自己管理：經它傳送的內容只存在你自己的伺服器上，Si4Gram 既不經手也看不到。這些資料的隱私與保存期限，由你部署的伺服器來保證。"],
        "SecutgRelayDecryptFailed": ["en": "The content cannot be opened (it may have been tampered with).", "zh-Hans": "内容解不开（可能被篡改）。", "zh-Hant": "內容解不開（可能被竄改）。"],
        "SecutgRelayDefault": ["en": "Default", "zh-Hans": "默认", "zh-Hant": "預設"],
        "SecutgRelayDefaultPolicy": ["en": "Default keep policy", "zh-Hans": "默认保存策略", "zh-Hant": "預設保存策略"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployAws": ["en": "AWS", "zh-Hans": "AWS", "zh-Hant": "AWS"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployCloudflare": ["en": "Cloudflare (largest free tier, least upkeep)", "zh-Hans": "Cloudflare（免费额度最大，最省心）", "zh-Hant": "Cloudflare（免費額度最大，最省心）"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployDocker": ["en": "Your own server (Docker, replace the domain with yours so HTTPS can be set up)", "zh-Hans": "自己的服务器（Docker，把域名换成你自己的，用来自动申请 HTTPS 证书）", "zh-Hant": "自己的伺服器（Docker，把網域換成你自己的，用來自動申請 HTTPS 憑證）"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployDryRun": ["en": "To see what the script would do first, add --dry-run to the command. It only prints the steps and runs nothing.", "zh-Hans": "想先看看脚本会做什么：在命令后面加上 --dry-run，它只打印每一步，什么都不执行。", "zh-Hant": "想先看看腳本會做什麼：在命令後面加上 --dry-run，它只印出每一步，什麼都不執行。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployEntry": ["en": "Deploy your own relay", "zh-Hans": "如何部署属于自己的信息中转", "zh-Hant": "如何部署屬於自己的訊息中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployGcp": ["en": "Google Cloud", "zh-Hans": "Google Cloud", "zh-Hant": "Google Cloud"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployNeeds": ["en": "You need a Cloudflare, AWS or Google Cloud account, or your own server with Docker and a domain name, plus a Mac or Linux computer to run one command in Terminal.", "zh-Hans": "需要：一个 Cloudflare、AWS 或 Google Cloud 账号，或者一台装有 Docker、并有域名的自己的服务器；另外一台能在终端里运行命令的 Mac 或 Linux 电脑。", "zh-Hant": "需要：一個 Cloudflare、AWS 或 Google Cloud 帳號，或者一台裝有 Docker、並有網域的自己的伺服器；另外一台能在終端機裡執行命令的 Mac 或 Linux 電腦。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployPrivacy": ["en": "The relay runs in your own cloud account or on your own server. Where content is stored, how long it is kept and when it is deleted are all up to you. The Si4Gram developers do not run your relay and never handle or see anything on it. With content encryption on (the default), the key travels only inside the chat message, so even your own server never sees the plain text.", "zh-Hans": "信息中转部署在你自己的云账号或服务器上：内容存在哪里、保存多久、什么时候删除，全部由你决定。Si4Gram 的开发者不运营你的中转站，不经手、也看不到上面的任何数据。开启内容加密时（默认开启），钥匙只随聊天消息传递，连你自己的服务器也看不到明文。", "zh-Hant": "訊息中轉部署在你自己的雲端帳號或伺服器上：內容存在哪裡、保存多久、什麼時候刪除，全部由你決定。Si4Gram 的開發者不營運你的中轉站，不經手、也看不到上面的任何資料。開啟內容加密時（預設開啟），鑰匙只隨聊天訊息傳遞，連你自己的伺服器也看不到明文。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployPrivacyTitle": ["en": "Your data stays entirely under your control", "zh-Hans": "数据隐私由你完全掌控", "zh-Hant": "資料隱私由你完全掌控"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployStep1": ["en": "1. Download the relay source code (address below) and open its folder in Terminal.", "zh-Hans": "1. 下载信息中转服务的源码（地址见下方），在终端里进入它的目录。", "zh-Hant": "1. 下載訊息中轉服務的原始碼（位址見下方），在終端機裡進入它的目錄。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployStep2": ["en": "2. Pick where to deploy and run the matching command (one of the four below). The script checks the tools and sign-in, creates what it needs, generates an upload token and deploys. It never signs in to any account for you.", "zh-Hans": "2. 选一个部署位置，运行对应的那一条命令（下面四选一）。脚本会检查工具和登录状态、创建需要的资源、生成上传令牌并完成部署；它不会替你登录任何账号。", "zh-Hant": "2. 選一個部署位置，執行對應的那一條命令（下面四選一）。腳本會檢查工具和登入狀態、建立需要的資源、產生上傳權杖並完成部署；它不會替你登入任何帳號。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployStep3": ["en": "3. When it finishes, the script prints your relay address and upload token.", "zh-Hans": "3. 部署完成后，脚本会打印出你的中转地址和上传令牌。", "zh-Hant": "3. 部署完成後，腳本會印出你的中轉位址和上傳權杖。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployStep4": ["en": "4. Come back here, tap 〔Add a custom message relay address〕 and enter the address and token.", "zh-Hans": "4. 回到这里，点〔添加自定义信息中转站地址〕，填入地址和上传令牌。", "zh-Hant": "4. 回到這裡，點〔新增自訂訊息中轉站位址〕，填入位址和上傳權杖。"],
        "SecutgRelayDeployTitle": ["en": "Deploy your own relay", "zh-Hans": "部署自己的信息中转", "zh-Hant": "部署自己的訊息中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayEnabled": ["en": "Send through the message relay", "zh-Hans": "通过信息中转发送", "zh-Hant": "透過訊息中轉傳送"],
        "SecutgRelayEncrypt": ["en": "Encrypt content (the key is only in the message, the relay cannot read it)", "zh-Hans": "内容加密（钥匙只在消息里，中转看不到）", "zh-Hant": "內容加密（金鑰只在訊息裡，中轉看不到）"],
        "SecutgRelayEncrypted": ["en": "encrypted", "zh-Hans": "已加密", "zh-Hant": "已加密"],
        "SecutgRelayFirstWins": ["en": "Whichever comes first ends it.", "zh-Hans": "先到先失效。", "zh-Hant": "先到先失效。"],
        "SecutgRelayGone": ["en": "⇄ No longer available (reads used up, expired or withdrawn)", "zh-Hans": "⇄ 内容已失效（次数用完 / 已过期 / 已撤回）", "zh-Hant": "⇄ 內容已失效（次數用完 / 已過期 / 已撤回）"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideDeployRow": ["en": "One-command deploy", "zh-Hans": "一键部署命令", "zh-Hant": "一鍵部署指令"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideEntry": ["en": "How does the message relay work?", "zh-Hans": "信息中转是怎么工作的？", "zh-Hant": "訊息中轉是怎麼運作的？"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideImageAlt": ["en": "Message relay flow diagram", "zh-Hans": "信息中转流程图", "zh-Hant": "訊息中轉流程圖"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideNote1": ["en": "The read count is shared by everyone: in a group, 1 read means only the first person to open it. Each of a person's devices counts separately.", "zh-Hans": "「读 N 次」是所有人共用的：群里读 1 次，就是第一个点开的人；同一个人的每台设备各算一次。", "zh-Hant": "「讀 N 次」是所有人共用的：群組裡讀 1 次，就是第一個點開的人；同一個人的每台裝置各算一次。"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideNote2": ["en": "Once content is on your device it stays readable there even after it expires on the relay. Deleting the message deletes the copies on both sides.", "zh-Hans": "内容取到本机后，就算中转上已经过期，本机也照样能看；删除这条消息时，双方本机的副本会一起删除。", "zh-Hant": "內容取到本機後，就算中轉上已經過期，本機也照樣能看；刪除這則訊息時，雙方本機的副本會一起刪除。"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideNote3": ["en": "iPhone, iPad and Mac only accept message relay addresses starting with https:// (the web version too). If you run your own relay, turn on HTTPS for it. Cloudflare, AWS and Google Cloud use https by default.", "zh-Hans": "iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 要求信息中转站地址必须以 https:// 开头（网页版也一样）。自己搭建时请为中转开启 HTTPS；部署到 Cloudflare、AWS、Google Cloud 默认就是 https。", "zh-Hant": "iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 要求訊息中轉站位址必須以 https:// 開頭（網頁版也一樣）。自己架設時請為中轉開啟 HTTPS；部署到 Cloudflare、AWS、Google Cloud 預設就是 https。"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideNotesTitle": ["en": "Good to know", "zh-Hans": "几点要知道", "zh-Hant": "幾點要知道"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideOpen": ["en": "Open", "zh-Hans": "打开", "zh-Hant": "打開"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideSelfHost": ["en": "The relay service is open source. It runs on Cloudflare, AWS, Google Cloud or your own server and deploys with one command. Then enter its address and upload token under 〔Add a custom message relay address〕.", "zh-Hans": "信息中转服务的代码是开源的，可以部署在 Cloudflare、AWS、Google Cloud 或你自己的服务器上，一条命令就能完成。部署后把地址和上传令牌填到〔添加自定义信息中转站地址〕里。", "zh-Hant": "訊息中轉服務的程式碼是開源的，可以部署在 Cloudflare、AWS、Google Cloud 或你自己的伺服器上，一條指令就能完成。部署後把位址和上傳權杖填到〔新增自訂訊息中轉站位址〕裡。"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideSelfHostTitle": ["en": "Run your own message relay", "zh-Hans": "自己搭建信息中转", "zh-Hant": "自己架設訊息中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideSourcePending": ["en": "The source address will be published soon", "zh-Hans": "源码地址即将公布", "zh-Hant": "原始碼位址即將公布"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideSourceRow": ["en": "Source code (GitHub)", "zh-Hans": "源码（GitHub）", "zh-Hant": "原始碼（GitHub）"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideTitle": ["en": "How the message relay works", "zh-Hans": "信息中转是怎么工作的", "zh-Hant": "訊息中轉是怎麼運作的"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideWhy": ["en": "Long text and images are not stored by Telegram. You decide how many times the content can be read and how long it is kept. It is deleted automatically when that runs out, and you can withdraw it at any time.", "zh-Hans": "长文本和图片不经过 Telegram 保存。你可以决定内容最多被读几次、保存多久，到期自动删除，也能随时撤回。", "zh-Hant": "長文字和圖片不經過 Telegram 保存。你可以決定內容最多被讀幾次、保存多久，到期自動刪除，也能隨時撤回。"],
        "SecutgRelayGuideWhyTitle": ["en": "Why use the message relay", "zh-Hans": "为什么用信息中转", "zh-Hant": "為什麼用訊息中轉"],
        "SecutgRelayHint": ["en": "Send text and images through a relay service. The chat only carries a reference.", "zh-Hans": "文本和图片经中转服务发送，聊天里只发一条引用。", "zh-Hant": "文字和圖片經中轉服務傳送，聊天裡只發一條引用。"],
