        "SecutgRelaySetDefault": ["en": "Make default", "zh-Hans": "设为默认", "zh-Hant": "設為預設"],
        "SecutgRelaySharedReadsNote": ["en": "Reads are shared by everyone: in a group, 1 read means only the first person to open it. Each of a person's devices counts separately.", "zh-Hans": "「读 N 次」是所有人共用的：群里读 1 次 = 第一个点开的人。同一人的每台设备各算一次。", "zh-Hant": "「讀 N 次」是所有人共用的：群組裡讀 1 次 = 第一個點開的人。同一人的每台裝置各算一次。"],
