        "SecutgStrangerUnknownSomeGroups": ["en": "This account is not in your contacts, and you share {count} group(s). Judge for yourself whether it may be an impersonation.", "zh-Hans": "此账号不在你的通讯录，与你有 {count} 个共同的群。请自行判断此账号是否是假冒账号。", "zh-Hant": "此帳號不在你的通訊錄，與你有 {count} 個共同的群組。請自行判斷此帳號是否是假冒帳號。"],
        "SecutgTagline": ["en": "An unofficial, private Telegram client for you", "zh-Hans": "你的私密版 Telegram 客户端（非官方）", "zh-Hant": "你的私密版 Telegram 用戶端（非官方）"],
