        "SecutgV2SafetyMismatchText": ["en": "Safety codes don't match — sending is paused. Confirm identity, then re-pair.", "zh-Hans": "安全码不一致，已暂停发送。请确认身份后重新配对。", "zh-Hant": "安全碼不一致，已暫停傳送。請確認身分後重新配對。"],
